          "expression": ",LOW-TIDE"
        },
        "text": [
          "You are in a long room, to the north of which is a wide area which\nwas formerly a reservoir, but now is merely a stream. You notice,\nhowever, that the level of the stream is rising quickly and that\nbefore long it will be impossible to cross here.",
          "There is a path along the stream to the east or west, a steep pathway\nclimbing southwest along the edge of a chasm, and a path leading into a\ncanyon to the southeast."
        ],
        "source_refs": [
          "SRC-ROOM-RESERVOIR-SOUTH",
          "SRC-ROUTINE-RESERVOIR-SOUTH-FCN"
        ]
